{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Packs of Panties</strong> is a falling blocks puzzle game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Prepare deliveries by aligning underwear blocks of the same type and connecting them with a box block of the same color to make them disappear! The game ends when no more blocks can be placed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/fa7726e6bfa3218ad094cd9b37986779.poster.avif?t=1761349448\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/fa7726e6bfa3218ad094cd9b37986779.webm?t=1761349448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/fa7726e6bfa3218ad094cd9b37986779.mp4?t=1761349448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover Marathon mode, a staple of games in this genre. Strategically place your blocks to fill as many boxes as possible and achieve the highest score during a session.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/0fa29688d86da08360bba41309382170.poster.avif?t=1761349448\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/0fa29688d86da08360bba41309382170.webm?t=1761349448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/0fa29688d86da08360bba41309382170.mp4?t=1761349448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This mode can be played by up to 3 players, either cooperatively\u2014where everyone contributes to the team score\u2014or competitively, where each player must collect as many panties as possible to stay in the game the longest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/41196f08bcbba73c744a4c2d230f064e.poster.avif?t=1761349448\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/41196f08bcbba73c744a4c2d230f064e.webm?t=1761349448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/41196f08bcbba73c744a4c2d230f064e.mp4?t=1761349448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Objective mode</i> offers limited rounds where you must fill a set number of boxes.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/165730b528b2dcedcfebbbddf1df67bb.poster.avif?t=1761349448\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/165730b528b2dcedcfebbbddf1df67bb.webm?t=1761349448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/165730b528b2dcedcfebbbddf1df67bb.mp4?t=1761349448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can cooperate with 1 or 2 other players to reach a shared goal, or compete to see who reaches their objective first.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/31bbebd0d2a98fa214175aa7ca5cd1a7.poster.avif?t=1761349448\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/31bbebd0d2a98fa214175aa7ca5cd1a7.webm?t=1761349448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/31bbebd0d2a98fa214175aa7ca5cd1a7.mp4?t=1761349448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Packs of Panties</strong> is perfect for relaxing or enjoying a friendly moment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026740?t=1761349448","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/1d3b46dc1d84f32a1821bc72cc242d39f28b00b6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761349448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/c2a49ed8b196d238ff436359500055f789abb5ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761349448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/c2a49ed8b196d238ff436359500055f789abb5ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761349448","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description